LowerArgsModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Expands an instruction Params string: SplitArgs(pstr) into tokens, classifies each via ClassifyArg, returning the argument-operand list.
    Provides: LowerArgs(pstr) -> args.
    DependsOn: SplitArgs, ClassifyArg.
    Composition: Native include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../LowerArgs/LowerArgs.sir).
